To ClassifyAll, given values which are a list of integer, returning a list of string
    the results are an empty list
    for each n in the values
        the results are the results with Classify of n added
    return the results

To Classify, given n which is an integer, returning a string
    if n modulo 15 is equal to 0
        return "FizzBuzz"
    otherwise if n modulo 3 is equal to 0
        return "Fizz"
    otherwise if n modulo 5 is equal to 0
        return "Buzz"
    otherwise
        return n as a string
